Acknowledgement
===============

The LLM query template in orag/llm.py and the alias example "RFB" in
orag/kb.py follow the ORAG paper: Xiao, Ding, Barry, Elkaref, De Mel and Han,
"ORAG: Ontology-Guided Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Theme-Specific Entity
Typing", COLM 2024, https://openreview.net/forum?id=cKBmZ2PZ6c. They are
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 with the rest of the code.

The game ontology in data/game/ builds on the ontology used in the ORAG paper.


Material not included
=====================

- Source texts and knowledge bases: the battery articles, the forum posts and
  news articles, and the knowledge bases built from them and from genshin-db,
  the game's community wikis, Wikipedia, Wikidata and BattINFO are not
  included. The annotations give the sources' identifiers and links.
- Game data: Genshin Impact names, texts and data are copyrighted material and
  trademarks of COGNOSPHERE PTE. LTD. (HoYoverse). Names of game entities and
  game terms appear in this repository only as identifiers, in the
  annotations, the game ontology, the examples, the rebuild instructions in
  DATA.md and the code's prompts. No text from the game is included.
- Models: orag/run.py uses Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct, Qwen3-Embedding-8B and
  all-MiniLM-L6-v2 by default, by their Hugging Face IDs. Their weights and
  outputs are not included; obtain each model under its own license.

